<!DOCTYPE suzuki [
<!ENTITY % sdatacharaents SYSTEM "..\config8\sdatacharaents.txt">
%sdatacharaents;
]>
<suzuki><manual>
<section sectnbr = "5A">
<servcat sctnbr = "05" scnbr = "01">
<configtype typenbr = "0">
<servinfotype sitcode = "6">
<servinfo servinfosgmlid = "AENLSB0A5106032" svcinfotypenbr = "08" svcinfoqualnbr = "02" page = "2" supplyoff = "1" modify = "0">
<title>
Oil Pump Assembly Disassembly and Reassembly
</title>
<ptxt>
<intxrefpoff refid = "AENLSB0A5106030">A/T Assembly Disassembly</intxrefpoff>
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
<intxrefpoff refid = "AENLSB0A5106062">A/T Assembly Reassembly</intxrefpoff>
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
<intxrefpoff refid = "AENLSB0A5106031">Oil Pump Assembly Components</intxrefpoff>
</ptxt>
<attention4>
<ptxt>
The oil pump body will lose its original performance if it is disassembled.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Do not disassemble the oil pump body.
</ptxt>
</attention4>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0A5106032001">
<title>
Disassembly
</title>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove oil strainer (1) from oil pump body.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IEL10C510155.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "84.472mm" ver = "01" gw = "168" gh = "223"/>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove O-ring (1).
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IEL10C510368.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "72.955mm" ver = "02" gw = "196" gh = "190"/>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove oil pump thrust washer (1).
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IEL10C510369.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "56.324mm" ver = "02" gw = "197" gh = "143"/>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove oil seal rings (1).
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IEL10C510370.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "57.669mm" ver = "02" gw = "197" gh = "147"/>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Using flat-bladed screwdriver (1) or the like, remove oil seal (2).
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IEL10C510156.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "51.582mm" ver = "01" gw = "190" gh = "130"/>
</figure>
</s1>
</servinfosub>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0A5106032002">
<title>
Reassembly
</title>
<ptxt>
<intxrefpoff refid = "AENLSB0A5106033">Oil Pump Assembly Inspection</intxrefpoff>
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Reverse disassembly procedure noting the following points.
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Apply grease to new oil seal lip portion, and then install new oil seal (1) to oil pump body (2).
</ptxt>
<materials>
<materialitem name = "ECSTAR Grease C" id = "M5A008" uid = "1545787518">
<m-part>
“A”
</m-part>
<m-desc>
Grease
</m-desc>
<m-number>
99000–25490
</m-number>
<m-name>
ECSTAR Grease C
</m-name>
</materialitem>
</materials>
<servicetool>
<servicetoolitem id = "L5A014">
<s-part>
(A)
</s-part>
<s-number num = "09913-85210">
09913–85210
</s-number>
</servicetoolitem>
</servicetool>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IEL10C510157.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "86.381mm" ver = "01" gw = "199" gh = "228"/>
</figure>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Use new seal rings and O-ring. Apply ATF before installation.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Tighten seal ring to 5 mm (0.2 in.), and then install seal rings.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Install oil strainer bolts (1) to specified torque.
</ptxt>
<torque>
<torqueitem id = "T5A018">
<t-part>
Oil strainer bolt
</t-part>
<t-part1>
a
</t-part1>
<t-value1>
5.4
</t-value1>
<t-value2>
0.55
</t-value2>
<t-value3>
4.0
</t-value3>
</torqueitem>
</torque>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IEL10C510158.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "84.384mm" ver = "01" gw = "167" gh = "223"/>
</figure>
</item>
</list1>
</servinfosub>
</servinfo>
</servinfotype>
</configtype>
</servcat>
</section></manual></suzuki>
